 dict(date="1873-06-03",label="The Berlin week (31 May – 6 June)",eyes=["naser","bancroft"],note="The Shah dines with Bismarck and Moltke and admires a kingdom of soldiers; the American minister, watching the same week, sees only bad table manners and a court kept waiting."),
