 dict(date="1873-06-20",label="Windsor and the Garter",eyes=["naser","victoria","burne"],note="Each side records the exchange of orders: the Garter for the Shah, the Lion and Sun for the Queen. He writes of her kindness; her journal and her commissioned painting fix the scene as a diplomatic necessity."),
